<title>USA: King Cty Hosp Dist, Wash., yields 5.63 pct in 2015.</title>
<headline>King Cty Hosp Dist, Wash., yields 5.63 pct in 2015.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co said it repriced $29.615 million of King County Public Hospital District No 1, Wash., hospital facilities refunding bonds, series 1997, for Valley Medical Center, with a top yield of 5.63 percent in 2015.</p>
